.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt HANDLE_DUP 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm handle_dup
.Nd duplicate a handle with reduced rights
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft Handle
.Fn handle_dup "Handle handle" "u32 rights"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call duplicates .Fa handle with rights intersected by .Fa rights .
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
